          "headersSize": 646,
          "cookies": [],
          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"businessDate\":\"2026-03-10\",\"showtimes\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-15538\",\"schedule\":{\"businessDate\":\"2026-03-10\",\"startsAt\":\"2026-03-10T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endsAt\":\"2026-03-10T19:56:00+00:00\",\"filmStartsAt\":\"2026-03-10T18:25:00+00:00\",\"filmEndsAt\":\"2026-03-10T19:56:00+00:00\",\"inSeatItemDelivery\":null},\"isSoldOut\":false,\"seatLayoutId\":\"RIC1-1-6\",\"filmId\":\"HO00006302\",\"siteId\":\"RIC1\",\"screenId\":\"RIC1-1\",\"areaCategories\":[{\"areaCategoryId\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true}],\"attributeIds\":[],\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"requires3dGlasses\":false,\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"restrictions\":[],\"filmAdvanceBookingRuleId\":null}],\"relatedData\":{\"sites\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Richmond\",\"translations\":[]},\"location\":{\"latitude\":51.4593,\"longitude\":-0.307},\"contactDetails\":{\"phoneNumbers\":[],\"email\":\"\",\"address\":{\"line1\":\"Water Lane,\",\"line2\":\"Richmond,\",\"city\":\"TW9 1TJ\"}},\"ianaTimeZoneName\":\"Europe/London\"}],\"films\":[{\"id\":\"HO00006302\",\"title\":{\"text\":\"EXHIBITION ON SCREEN: Turner & Constable\",\"translations\":[]},\"synopsis\":{\"text\":\"Two of Britain’s greatest painters, J.M.W. Turner and John Constable were also the greatest of rivals. Born within a year of each other, both used landscape painting to reflect the changing world around them. Tate Britain is bringing these two greats together for a groundbreaking exhibition, in London from November 2025 to April 2026, and Exhibition on Screen once again has exclusive and privileged access to bring their extraordinary art and remarkable stories to the big screen in February so that you can enjoy both film and exhibition together. Discover unexpected sides to both artists with intimate views of sketchbooks and personal items and insights from leading experts.\\n\\nTurner’s blazing sunsets and sublime scenes from his travels and Constable’s idealised depictions of beloved places from home whipped the public of the time into a frenzy of enthusiasm. Constable represents the very best of the old school of realism and pastoral nostalgia; Turner, an exciting new way of depicting emotion and dreamlike impressions. Critics compared their starkly different styles to a clash of ‘fire and water’. Don’t miss this opportunity to see these greats side-by-side, as they so often were in life, on the big screen for the first time.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"Celebrating the 250th anniversary of their births, this unmissable new documentary explores Turner and Constable’s intertwined lives and legacies.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"VS00000007\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-03-06\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":91,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000511\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000006\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"9d7ae073-0057-49b4-9022-08ac27e1c549\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00006302\",\"hoCode\":\"A000007775\",\"eventId\":\"0000000047\",\"distributorName\":\"Seventh Art Productions\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000000511\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"David \",\"familyName\":\"Bickerstaff\",\"middleName\":null}}],\"genres\":[{\"id\":\"0000000006\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Documentary\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":null}],\"censorRatings\":[{\"id\":\"VS00000007\",\"classification\":{\"text\":\"TBC\",\"translations\":[]},\"classificationDescription\":{\"text\":\"TBC - Adults.\",\"translations\":[]},\"ageRestriction\":{\"minimumAge\":0}}],\"attributes\":[],\"screens\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-1\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Screen 1\",\"translations\":[]}}],\"events\":[{\"id\":\"0000000047\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Exhibition on Screen\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortName\":{\"text\":\"EOS\",\"translations\":[]},\"description\":{\"text\":\"Working with top international museums and galleries, Exhibition on Screen create films which offer a cinematic immersion into the world’s best loved art, accompanied by insights from the world’s leading historians and arts critics. Executive Producer & Director Phil Grabsky has been making documentaries for over 30 years and is a multi award-winner. For the past 15 years he and award-winning director David Bickerstaff along with their colleagues have been both a major independent producer of arts films for TV as well as a pioneer (and largest producer) of cultural documentaries for the cinema.\\n\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-04-01\",\"endDate\":\"2099-12-31\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}",
            "size": 2470
