 performance, and the beauty of world-class art with cinemagoers in more than 1,500 cinemas and 50 countries around the world.\\n\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-09-01\",\"endDate\":\"2026-06-30\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"CAN2\",\"COL1\",\"HOX1\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"SOH1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}",
