ming techniques, tailored to every play, we bring you each performance as it happens, in all its glory. From close-ups that capture every flicker of emotion, to sweeping wide shots of the stage. Whether you come along to the live broadcast, or catch one of many replays, you’ll have the best seats in the house.\",\"translations\":[]},\"schedule\":{\"startDate\":\"2024-01-01\",\"endDate\":\"2099-12-31\"},\"siteIds\":[\"ALD1\",\"BLO1\",\"CAM1\",\"CAN01\",\"CAN2\",\"COL1\",\"HOX1\",\"KIN1\",\"KNU1\",\"MAY1\",\"OXF1\",\"RIC1\",\"SHE1\",\"SOH1\",\"VIC1\",\"WIM01\"]}],\"filmAdvanceBookingRules\":[],\"areaCategories\":[{\"id\":\"RIC1-0000000001\",\"name\":{\"text\":\"Standard\",\"translations\":[]},\"hopk\":\"0000000000\",\"isAllocatedSeating\":true,\"isInSeatItemDeliveryAvailable\":false}]}}",
